# MotoPass — Cloudflare Pages _headers
# CRITICAL: Never cache poisoned SPA fallback (index.html served as .js during deploy).

/* 
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  # CRITICAL — script-src needs 'unsafe-eval': src/lib/schema.ts compiles ajv schemas at module
  # scope via new Function. Without it the entry import() throws "Error compiling schema" and
  # the boot guard enters a reload loop. static.cloudflareinsights.com is Cloudflare's auto
  # Web Analytics beacon injected into our HTML (allowlisted so it doesn't spam CSP violations).
  # connect-src needs api.btcmap.org (BTC Map) and wss://* (Nostr relays, incl. VITE_NOSTR_RELAY
  # overrides — docs mandate wss: only, never http://). api.coingecko.com is the live BTC/fiat
  # price source for the FX layer (falls back to an honest stale snapshot when unreachable).
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://analytics.giveabit.io https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https://api.satohash.io https://mempool.space https://analytics.giveabit.io https://api.btcmap.org https://api.coingecko.com wss://*

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store, must-revalidate
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-store

/assets/*.css
  Content-Type: text/css; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-cache

/assets/*.js
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate
  CDN-Cache-Control: no-cache

/research/*.json
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400